# Never upload the soundtrack. It is third-party copyrighted audio, gitignored for that
# reason (docs/adr/0003-keep-the-soundtrack-out-of-the-repo.md), and Vite copies
# everything under assets/ into the build, so a `vercel deploy` from a working tree that
# has it would publish it. Git-triggered deploys never see it; this covers CLI uploads.
assets/audio/music/
RobotWarrior.html
dist-single/
